// 03-gross-margin-measure.tmdl
// Demo 3: reference answer for prompts/03-measure-in-tmdl.md.
// Goes into definition/tables/salesInvoices.tmdl, inside "table salesInvoices", after the Revenue measure.
// git diff after the change: these lines, and nothing else.

	/// Gross margin: revenue minus cost of goods sold, posted invoices only.
	measure 'Gross Margin' = [Revenue] - [Cost]
		formatString: #,0.00
